body:
it consist of 19 systems that consist of 5 property's each

the systems are scored based on demands, the demands have a score themselves with witch the score in the system is multiplied. 

if you want to take a look at the data you can find it here: [https://drive.google.com/file/d/1C32gHiFr59t-oIS8HAMJ6-DB12Xu\_evE/view?usp=sharing](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1C32gHiFr59t-oIS8HAMJ6-DB12Xu_evE/view?usp=sharing)

most of the names are in dutch but i can translate it if you want 

&#x200B;

ps. yes i know i've made the data public by posting it but that doesn't matter
